---- MODULE LevelClaims ----
THEOREM ASSUME NEW VARIABLE x PROVE x' = x'
PROOF OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW STATE P PROVE P = P
PROOF OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW ACTION A PROVE A = A
PROOF OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW TEMPORAL P PROVE P => P
PROOF OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW STATE F(_), NEW VARIABLE x PROVE F(x) = F(x)
PROOF OBVIOUS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW ACTION A(_), NEW VARIABLE x PROVE A(x) = A(x)
PROOF OBVIOUS
====
